取","explanation":"Yarn 2+ 的全域套件快取。`yarn install` 會重新取得。"},"bun-cache":{"title":"Bun 安裝快取","explanation":"`bun install` 下載的套件。需要時會重新取得。"},"deno-cache":{"title":"Deno 快取","explanation":"Deno 的遠端模組和 npm 套件全域快取。下次執行時會重建。"},"node-gyp-cache":{"title":"node-gyp 標頭檔","explanation":"為編譯原生模組而下載的 Node.js 標頭檔。需要時會重新下載。"},"typescript-cache":{"title":"TypeScript 型別快取","explanation":"編輯器的 TypeScript 伺服器自動下載的型別定義。"},"nvm-versions":{"title":"nvm Node.js 版本","explanation":"已安裝的 Node.js 版本。用 `nvm uninstall <version>` 移除不用的版本。"},"nvm-cache":{"title":"nvm 下載快取","explanation":"nvm 為已安裝版本下載的 Node.js 壓縮檔。"},"fnm-versions":{"title":"fnm Node.js 版本","explanation":"fnm 安裝的 Node.js 版本。用 `fnm uninstall <version>` 移除不用的版本。"},"volta-tools":{"title":"Volta 工具鏈","explanation":"由 Volta 管理的 Node、npm 和全域工具。請在 Volta 中移除不用的版本。"},"playwright-browsers":{"title":"Playwright 瀏覽器","explanation":"為端對端測試下載的瀏覽器。可用 `npx playwright install` 重新安裝。"},"puppeteer-browsers":{"title":"Puppeteer 瀏覽器","explanation":"Puppeteer 下載的 Chrome 建置版本。可用 `npx puppeteer browsers install` 重新安裝。"},"cypress-cache":{"title":"Cypress 二進位檔","explanation":"你安裝過的每個版本的 Cypress App 二進位檔。可用 `npx cypress install` 重新安裝。"},"electron-cache":{"title":"Electron 下載項目","explanation":"建置 Electron App 時下載的 Electron 執行環境和建置工具。"},"updater-caches":{"title":"App 更新程式快取","explanation":"已套用之更新的已下載安裝程式。"},"chrome-headless-shell":{"title":"Chrome headless shell","explanation":"瀏覽器測試工具下載的無介面 Chrome 建置版本。測試需要時會重新下載。"},"pip-cache":{"title":"pip 快取","explanation":"已下載的 Python wheel。"},"uv-cache":{"title":"uv 快取","explanation":"uv 快取的套件和建置結果。下次安裝時會重新取得。"},"uv-python":{"title":"uv 管理的 Python 版本","explanation":"uv 安裝的 Python 直譯器。用 `uv python uninstall <version>` 移除不用的版本。"},"uv-tools":{"title":"uv 工具","explanation":"以 `uv tool install` 安裝的命令列工具。用 `uv tool uninstall <name>` 移除。"},"poetry-cache":{"title":"Poetry 快取","explanation":"Poetry 下載的套件。`poetry install` 會重新取得。"},"poetry-virtualenvs":{"title":"Poetry 虛擬環境","explanation":"Poetry 為你的專案建立的虛擬環境。`poetry install` 會重新建立，